Run from the repository root:

```sh
docker compose -f compose/docker-compose.yaml up --build
```

- Frontend: <http://localhost:8080>
- Backend API: <http://localhost:5000/api/notes>
- PostgreSQL: `localhost:5432` (`notesdb`, `notesuser`)

See the root [README](../README.md) for Kubernetes, Helm, and CI/CD deployment
scenarios.
